ration:none; height:0in; text-position:normal; font-stretch:normal">3. prettier configuration</c><c props="width:0in; font-family:Times New Roman; display:inline; font-variant:normal; font-weight:bold; lang:-none-; font-style:normal; text-transform:none; list-style:None; color:000000; bgcolor:ff80c0; font-size:18pt; homogeneous:1; text-decoration:none; height:0in; text-position:normal; font-stretch:normal"></c></p>
<p xid="538"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p xid="534"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p xid="31">npm install prettier<c></c></p>
<p xid="32"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p xid="33">Create a prettier config file and ignore file in home directory<c></c></p>
<p xid="543"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p xid="34"><c props="font-weight:bold">.prettierrc</c><c props="font-weight:bold"></c></p>
<p xid="544"><c props="font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:12pt; color:000000; text-decoration:none; text-position:normal; font-weight:bold; font-style:normal; lang:-none-">.prettierignor</c><c props="font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:12pt; color:000000; text-decoration:none; text-position:normal; font-weight:bold; font-style:normal; lang:-none-"></c></p>
<p xid="545"><c props="font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:12pt; color:000000; text-decoration:none; text-position:normal; font-weight:bold; font-style:normal; lang:-none-"></c><c></c></p>
<p xid="35">.prettierrc file configuratoin as below:</p>
<p xid="546"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p xid="36"><c props="bgcolor:c0c0c0">{</c><c props="bgcolor:c0c0c0"></c></p>
<p xid="37"><c props="bgcolor:c0c0c0">"singleQuote": false,</c><c props="bgcolor:c0c0c0"></c></p>
<p xid="38"><c props="bgcolor:c0c0c0">"bracketSpacing": true,</c><c props="bgcolor:c0c0c0"></c></p>
<p xid="39"><c props="bgcolor:c0c0c0">"tabWidth": 2,</c><c props="bgcolor:c0c0c0"></c></p>
<p xid="40"><c props="bgcolor:c0c0c0">"semi": true,</c><c props="bgcolor:c0c0c0"></c></p>
<p xid="41"><c props="bgcolor:c0c0c0">"trailingComma": "es5"</c><c props="bgcolor:c0c0c0"></c></p>
<p xid="42"><c props="bgcolor:c0c0c0">}</c><c props="bgcolor:c0c0c0"></c></p>
<p xid="43">----------------------------------------<c></c></p>
<p xid="44"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p xid="547"><c></c>.prettierignore file mentioned below:</p>
