<p xid="86">Points to take care while connecting DB<c></c></p>
<p xid="87"><c props="font-weight:bold">1.</c><c props="font-weight:bold"></c>Try catch</p>
<p xid="89">-Always wrap DB connection in the try catch so that if any error then easily it will be handled<c></c></p>
<p xid="90"><c props="font-weight:bold">2.</c><c props="font-weight:bold"></c>Async await</p>
<p xid="92">- Database would be in diff continental and your code base can be in diff, so when you try talking to the DB it takes time. </p>
