<p xid="615" props="left-shadow-color:grey; right-space:0.02in; toc-label-type1:numeric; toc-label-type2:numeric; toc-label-type3:numeric; toc-label-type4:numeric; border-shadow-merge:0; toc-label-inherits1:1; text-folded:0; top-shadow:0; list-decimal:.; bot-space:0.02in; margin-left:0pt; top-space:0.02in; bot-shadow:0; right-shadow:0; toc-has-label1:1; orphans:2; toc-page-type4:numeric; toc-tab-leader3:dot; toc-label-inherits3:1; shading-pattern:0; toc-heading:Contents; text-indent:0in; toc-source-style1:Heading 1; toc-source-style2:Heading 2; toc-source-style3:Heading 3; widows:2; toc-tab-leader1:dot; margin-right:0pt; toc-label-inherits2:1; toc-tab-leader4:dot; toc-label-inherits4:1; toc-page-type2:numeric; keep-with-next:no; toc-indent1:0.5in; toc-indent2:0.5in; text-folded-id:0; toc-indent4:0.5in; list-tag:0; top-shadow-color:grey; margin-top:0pt; text-align:left; toc-page-type1:numeric; line-height:1.0; toc-page-type3:numeric; toc-has-label2:1; toc-has-label3:1; toc-has-label4:1; toc-tab-leader2:dot; border-merge:0; margin-bottom:0pt; default-tab-interval:0.5in; toc-label-start1:1; toc-label-start2:1; right-shadow-color:grey; toc-dest-style1:Contents 1; toc-source-style4:Heading 4; shading-foreground-color:white; toc-has-heading:1; list-delim:%L; start-value:1; left-shadow:0; bot-shadow-color:grey; toc-heading-style:Contents Header; left-space:0.02in; toc-label-start3:1; toc-label-start4:1; toc-dest-style2:Contents 2; toc-dest-style3:Contents 3; toc-dest-style4:Contents 4; keep-together:no; shading-background-color:white; dom-dir:ltr; format:%*%d.; toc-indent3:0.5in"><c></c>main focus in express will be req and res.</p>
<p xid="151"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p xid="152"><c props="font-weight:bold">installed</c><c props="font-weight:bold"></c></p>
<p xid="153">cors<c></c></p>
<p xid="155">cookie-parser<c></c></p>
<p xid="156"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p xid="616"><c></c><c props="font-weight:bold">app.use</c> - it will be used for the middleware</p>
<p xid="618"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p xid="158">cors is a middleware and will be initited using app.<c></c></p>
<p xid="619"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p xid="159">//<c props="font-weight:bold">its simple form to mention the cors</c><c props="font-weight:bold"></c></p>
<p xid="160">app.use(cors());<c></c></p>
<p xid="620"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p xid="161">//<c props="font-weight:bold">advanced form </c><c props="font-weight:bold"></c>to mention the cors, env need to set or use direct value here</p>
<p xid="162"><c props="bgcolor:c0c0c0">app.use(cors({</c><c props="bgcolor:c0c0c0"></c></p>
<p xid="163"><c props="bgcolor:c0c0c0">origin:process.env.CORS_ORIGIN,</c><c props="bgcolor:c0c0c0"></c></p>
<p xid="164"><c props="bgcolor:c0c0c0">credentials:true</c><c props="bgcolor:c0c0c0"></c></p>
<p xid="165"><c props="bgcolor:c0c0c0">}))</c><c props="bgcolor:c0c0c0"></c></p>
<p xid="621"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p xid="622">in <c props="font-weight:bold">.env file </c><c props="font-weight:bold"></c></p>
<p xid="623" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">CORS_ORIGIN=http://localhost:517</p>
<p xid="166">**************************************<c></c></p>
<p xid="1111">Whenever front end send a POST/PUT request then front end attachch some data in body and send that to server tto processinfornation. </p>
<p xid="1112"><c></c></p>
<p xid="1114">Express server by default dont understand and convert the body data to json or readable format. <br/><br/>In order to do that server needs some converted kind of </p>
<p xid="1115">1. body parser</p>
<p xid="1116">2. express.json </p>
<p xid="1113"><c></c></p>
<p xid="167" props="left-shadow-color:grey; right-space:0.02in; toc-label-type1:numeric; toc-label-type2:numeric; toc-label-type3:numeric; toc-label-type4:numeric; border-shadow-merge:0; toc-label-inherits1:1; text-folded:0; top-shadow:0; list-decimal:.; bot-space:0.02in; margin-left:0pt; top-space:0.02in; bot-shadow:0; right-shadow:0; toc-has-label1:1; orphans:2; toc-page-type4:numeric; toc-tab-leader3:dot; toc-label-inherits3:1; shading-pattern:0; toc-heading:Contents; text-indent:0in; toc-source-style1:Heading 1; toc-source-style2:Heading 2; toc-source-style3:Heading 3; widows:2; toc-tab-leader1:dot; margin-right:0pt; toc-label-inherits2:1; toc-tab-leader4:dot; toc-label-inherits4:1; toc-page-type2:numeric; keep-with-next:no; toc-indent1:0.5in; toc-indent2:0.5in; text-folded-id:0; toc-indent4:0.5in; list-tag:0; top-shadow-color:grey; margin-top:0pt; text-align:left; toc-page-type1:numeric; line-height:1.0; toc-page-type3:numeric; toc-has-label2:1; toc-has-label3:1; toc-has-label4:1; toc-tab-leader2:dot; border-merge:0; margin-bottom:0pt; default-tab-interval:0.5in; toc-label-start1:1; toc-label-start2:1; right-shadow-color:grey; toc-dest-style1:Contents 1; toc-source-style4:Heading 4; shading-foreground-color:white; toc-has-heading:1; list-delim:%L; start-value:1; left-shadow:0; bot-shadow-color:grey; toc-heading-style:Contents Header; left-space:0.02in; toc-label-start3:1; toc-label-start4:1; toc-dest-style2:Contents 2; toc-dest-style3:Contents 3; toc-dest-style4:Contents 4; keep-together:no; shading-background-color:white; dom-dir:ltr; format:%*%d.; toc-indent3:0.5in"><c props="width:0in; font-family:Times New Roman; display:inline; font-variant:normal; font-weight:normal; lang:-none-; font-style:normal; text-transform:none; list-style:None; color:000000; bgcolor:ffff00; font-size:12pt; homogeneous:1; text-decoration:none; height:0in; text-position:normal; font-stretch:normal">express.json() middleware and file limit</c><c props="width:0in; font-family:Times New Roman; display:inline; font-variant:normal; font-weight:normal; lang:-none-; font-style:normal; text-transform:none; list-style:None; color:000000; bgcolor:ffff00; font-size:12pt; homogeneous:1; text-decoration:none; height:0in; text-position:normal; font-stretch:normal"></c></p>
<p xid="625" props="left-shadow-color:grey; right-space:0.02in; toc-label-type1:numeric; toc-label-type2:numeric; toc-label-type3:numeric; toc-label-type4:numeric; border-shadow-merge:0; toc-label-inherits1:1; text-folded:0; top-shadow:0; list-decimal:.; bot-space:0.02in; margin-left:0pt; top-space:0.02in; bot-shadow:0; right-shadow:0; toc-has-label1:1; orphans:2; toc-page-type4:numeric; toc-tab-leader3:dot; toc-label-inherits3:1; shading-pattern:0; toc-heading:Contents; text-indent:0in; toc-source-style1:Heading 1; toc-source-style2:Heading 2; toc-source-style3:Heading 3; widows:2; toc-tab-leader1:dot; margin-right:0pt; toc-label-inherits2:1; toc-tab-leader4:dot; toc-label-inherits4:1; toc-page-type2:numeric; keep-with-next:no; toc-indent1:0.5in; toc-indent2:0.5in; text-folded-id:0; toc-indent4:0.5in; list-tag:0; top-shadow-color:grey; margin-top:0pt; text-align:left; toc-page-type1:numeric; line-height:1.0; toc-page-type3:numeric; toc-has-label2:1; toc-has-label3:1; toc-has-label4:1; toc-tab-leader2:dot; border-merge:0; margin-bottom:0pt; default-tab-interval:0.5in; toc-label-start1:1; toc-label-start2:1; right-shadow-color:grey; toc-dest-style1:Contents 1; toc-source-style4:Heading 4; shading-foreground-color:white; toc-has-heading:1; list-delim:%L; start-value:1; left-shadow:0; bot-shadow-color:grey; toc-heading-style:Contents Header; left-space:0.02in; toc-label-start3:1; toc-label-start4:1; toc-dest-style2:Contents 2; toc-dest-style3:Contents 3; toc-dest-style4:Contents 4; keep-together:no; shading-background-color:white; dom-dir:ltr; format:%*%d.; toc-indent3:0.5in"><c props="width:0in; font-family:Times New Roman; display:inline; font-variant:normal; font-weight:normal; lang:-none-; font-style:normal; text-transform:none; list-style:None; color:000000; bgcolor:ffff00; font-size:12pt; homogeneous:1; text-decoration:none; height:0in; text-position:normal; font-stretch:normal"></c><c></c></p>
<p xid="168"><c props="font-weight:bold; font-size:22pt">express.json()</c><c props="font-weight:bold; font-size:22pt"></c></p>
<p xid="628"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p xid="995">This comes in picture when we have to work on the req object. The json data coming in req as a raw stream will be converted to json object . </p>
<p xid="169">express.json() is a middleware that parses the incoming JSON payloads in the request body.<c></c></p>
<p xid="170">can customise the properties as below:<c></c></p>
<p xid="629"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p xid="171"><c props="font-weight:bold">1)</c><c props="font-weight:bold"></c>limit: ”16kb”</p>
<p xid="630">Specifiy the limit of the payload</p>
<p xid="631"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p xid="174"><c props="font-weight:bold">2)</c><c props="font-weight:bold"></c>strict: true</p>
<p xid="177">If its true then accept only json objects and arrays<c></c></p>
<p xid="178">if its false then accept primitive JSON values like number and string.<c></c></p>
<p xid="632"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p xid="179"><c props="font-weight:bold">3)</c><c props="font-weight:bold"></c>reviver</p>
<p xid="181">- its a function that can transform the parsed json values before putting them in req.body.<c></c></p>
<p xid="182"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p xid="633"><c></c><c props="bgcolor:c0c0c0">app.use(express.json({</c></p>
<p xid="183"><c props="bgcolor:c0c0c0">reviver:(key, value)=&gt;{</c><c props="bgcolor:c0c0c0"></c></p>
<p xid="184"><c props="bgcolor:c0c0c0">if( typeof value ==="String”) return value.toUpperCase();</c><c props="bgcolor:c0c0c0"></c></p>
<p xid="185"><c props="bgcolor:c0c0c0">return value;</c><c props="bgcolor:c0c0c0"></c></p>
<p xid="186"><c props="bgcolor:c0c0c0">}}))</c><c props="bgcolor:c0c0c0"></c></p>
<p xid="634"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p xid="187"><c props="font-weight:bold">4) type</c><c props="font-weight:bold"></c></p>
<p xid="189">- determine which requests are parsed.<c></c></p>
<p xid="190">default ‘application/json’<c></c></p>
<p xid="191">If client sends data in form of req like text/html then have to add the middleware here in order to parse the in text/html format<c></c></p>
<p xid="635"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p xid="192"><c props="font-weight:bold">5) inflate</c><c props="font-weight:bold"></c></p>
<p xid="194">- it will automatically decompress gzipped or dflated request bodies.<c></c></p>
<p xid="195">default is true<c></c></p>
<p xid="196">limit: '1mb',<c></c></p>
<p xid="197">strict: true,<c></c></p>
<p xid="198">reviver: null,<c></c></p>
<p xid="199">type: 'application/json',<c></c></p>
<p xid="200">inflate: true<c></c></p>
<p xid="201">}));<c></c></p>
<p xid="636"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p xid="202">*****************************************<c></c></p>
<p xid="637"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p xid="638" props="left-shadow-color:grey; right-space:0.02in; toc-label-type1:numeric; toc-label-type2:numeric; toc-label-type3:numeric; toc-label-type4:numeric; border-shadow-merge:0; toc-label-inherits1:1; text-folded:0; top-shadow:0; list-decimal:.; bot-space:0.02in; margin-left:0pt; top-space:0.02in; bot-shadow:0; right-shadow:0; toc-has-label1:1; orphans:2; toc-has-label2:1; start-value:1; toc-label-inherits3:1; toc-heading:Contents; text-indent:0in; toc-source-style1:Heading 1; toc-source-style2:Heading 2; toc-source-style3:Heading 3; widows:2; toc-tab-leader1:dot; margin-right:0pt; toc-label-inherits2:1; toc-tab-leader4:dot; toc-label-inherits4:1; shading-pattern:0; keep-with-next:no; toc-indent1:0.5in; toc-indent2:0.5in; text-folded-id:0; toc-indent4:0.5in; list-tag:0; top-shadow-color:grey; margin-top:0pt; text-align:left; toc-page-type1:numeric; line-height:1.0; toc-page-type3:numeric; toc-page-type4:numeric; toc-has-label3:1; toc-has-label4:1; toc-tab-leader2:dot; border-merge:0; toc-tab-leader3:dot; margin-bottom:0pt; default-tab-interval:0.5in; toc-heading-style:Contents Header; left-space:0.02in; right-shadow-color:grey; toc-dest-style1:Contents 1; toc-source-style4:Heading 4; shading-foreground-color:white; toc-has-heading:1; list-delim:%L; toc-page-type2:numeric; left-shadow:0; bot-shadow-color:grey; toc-label-start1:1; toc-label-start2:1; toc-label-start3:1; toc-label-start4:1; toc-dest-style2:Contents 2; toc-dest-style3:Contents 3; toc-dest-style4:Contents 4; keep-together:no; shading-background-color:white; dom-dir:ltr; format:%*%d.; toc-indent3:0.5in"><c></c><c props="width:0in; font-family:Times New Roman; display:inline; font-variant:normal; font-weight:bold; lang:-none-; font-style:normal; text-transform:none; color:000000; homogeneous:1; bgcolor:transparent; font-size:22pt; text-decoration:none; list-style:None; height:0in; text-position:normal; font-stretch:normal">express.urlencoded</c></p>
<p xid="203" props="left-shadow-color:grey; right-space:0.02in; toc-label-type1:numeric; toc-label-type2:numeric; toc-label-type3:numeric; toc-label-type4:numeric; border-shadow-merge:0; toc-label-inherits1:1; text-folded:0; top-shadow:0; list-decimal:.; bot-space:0.02in; margin-left:0pt; top-space:0.02in; bot-shadow:0; right-shadow:0; toc-has-label1:1; orphans:2; toc-page-type4:numeric; toc-tab-leader3:dot; toc-label-inherits3:1; shading-pattern:0; toc-heading:Contents; text-indent:0in; toc-source-style1:Heading 1; toc-source-style2:Heading 2; toc-source-style3:Heading 3; widows:2; toc-tab-leader1:dot; margin-right:0pt; toc-label-inherits2:1; toc-tab-leader4:dot; toc-label-inherits4:1; toc-page-type2:numeric; keep-with-next:no; toc-indent1:0.5in; toc-indent2:0.5in; text-folded-id:0; toc-indent4:0.5in; list-tag:0; top-shadow-color:grey; margin-top:0pt; text-align:left; toc-page-type1:numeric; line-height:1.0; toc-page-type3:numeric; toc-has-label2:1; toc-has-label3:1; toc-has-label4:1; toc-tab-leader2:dot; border-merge:0; margin-bottom:0pt; default-tab-interval:0.5in; toc-label-start1:1; toc-label-start2:1; right-shadow-color:grey; toc-dest-style1:Contents 1; toc-source-style4:Heading 4; shading-foreground-color:white; toc-has-heading:1; list-delim:%L; start-value:1; left-shadow:0; bot-shadow-color:grey; toc-heading-style:Contents Header; left-space:0.02in; toc-label-start3:1; toc-label-start4:1; toc-dest-style2:Contents 2; toc-dest-style3:Contents 3; toc-dest-style4:Contents 4; keep-together:no; shading-background-color:white; dom-dir:ltr; format:%*%d.; toc-indent3:0.5in"><c props="width:0in; font-family:Times New Roman; display:inline; font-variant:normal; font-weight:normal; lang:-none-; font-style:normal; text-transform:none; list-style:None; color:000000; bgcolor:ffff00; font-size:12pt; homogeneous:1; text-decoration:none; height:0in; text-position:normal; font-stretch:normal">app.use(express.urlencoded({extended:true, limit:”16kb”}))</c><c props="width:0in; font-family:Times New Roman; display:inline; font-variant:normal; font-weight:normal; lang:-none-; font-style:normal; text-transform:none; list-style:None; color:000000; bgcolor:ffff00; font-size:12pt; homogeneous:1; text-decoration:none; height:0in; text-position:normal; font-stretch:normal"></c></p>
<p xid="640"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p xid="204">This middleware used to parse application/x-www=urlencoded request.<c></c></p>
<p xid="641"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p xid="205">example data which will come in url<c></c></p>
<p xid="642"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p xid="206">username=ravi &amp; age=28<c></c></p>
<p xid="207">after parsing, express puut it in req.body<c></c></p>
<p xid="208">req.body = {username:"ravi”, age:”28”}<c></c></p>
<p xid="639"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p xid="209">**********************<c></c></p>
