<p xid="718"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p xid="268"><c props="font-weight:bold">node.bcrypt.js</c><c props="font-weight:bold"></c> - This library help you hash the password.</p>
<p xid="269"><c props="font-weight:bold">jsonwebtoken</c><c props="font-weight:bold"></c> - JWT,</p>
<p xid="270">In order to use above features into the code do below.<c></c></p>
<p xid="720"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p xid="271" props="left-shadow-color:grey; right-space:0.02in; toc-label-type1:numeric; toc-label-type2:numeric; toc-label-type3:numeric; toc-label-type4:numeric; border-shadow-merge:0; toc-label-inherits1:1; text-folded:0; top-shadow:0; list-decimal:.; bot-space:0.02in; margin-left:0pt; top-space:0.02in; bot-shadow:0; right-shadow:0; toc-has-label1:1; orphans:2; toc-page-type4:numeric; toc-tab-leader3:dot; toc-label-inherits3:1; shading-pattern:0; toc-heading:Contents; text-indent:0in; toc-source-style1:Heading 1; toc-source-style2:Heading 2; toc-source-style3:Heading 3; widows:2; toc-tab-leader1:dot; margin-right:0pt; toc-label-inherits2:1; toc-tab-leader4:dot; toc-label-inherits4:1; toc-page-type2:numeric; keep-with-next:no; toc-indent1:0.5in; toc-indent2:0.5in; text-folded-id:0; toc-indent4:0.5in; list-tag:0; top-shadow-color:grey; margin-top:0pt; text-align:left; toc-page-type1:numeric; line-height:1.0; toc-page-type3:numeric; toc-has-label2:1; toc-has-label3:1; toc-has-label4:1; toc-tab-leader2:dot; border-merge:0; margin-bottom:0pt; default-tab-interval:0.5in; toc-label-start1:1; toc-label-start2:1; right-shadow-color:grey; toc-dest-style1:Contents 1; toc-source-style4:Heading 4; shading-foreground-color:white; toc-has-heading:1; list-delim:%L; start-value:1; left-shadow:0; bot-shadow-color:grey; toc-heading-style:Contents Header; left-space:0.02in; toc-label-start3:1; toc-label-start4:1; toc-dest-style2:Contents 2; toc-dest-style3:Contents 3; toc-dest-style4:Contents 4; keep-together:no; shading-background-color:white; dom-dir:ltr; format:%*%d.; toc-indent3:0.5in"><c props="width:0in; font-family:Times New Roman; display:inline; font-variant:normal; font-weight:normal; lang:-none-; font-style:normal; text-transform:none; list-style:None; color:000000; bgcolor:ffff00; font-size:12pt; homogeneous:1; text-decoration:none; height:0in; text-position:normal; font-stretch:normal">1. These feature / action will be run before saving data in database and after user perfoam save operation</c><c props="width:0in; font-family:Times New Roman; display:inline; font-variant:normal; font-weight:normal; lang:-none-; font-style:normal; text-transform:none; list-style:None; color:000000; bgcolor:ffff00; font-size:12pt; homogeneous:1; text-decoration:none; height:0in; text-position:normal; font-stretch:normal"></c>.</p>
<p xid="721"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p xid="272">user clicked on save =&gt; middleware =&gt; database operation performaed and saved date.<c></c></p>
<p xid="722"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p xid="273" props="left-shadow-color:grey; right-space:0.02in; toc-label-type1:numeric; toc-label-type2:numeric; toc-label-type3:numeric; toc-label-type4:numeric; border-shadow-merge:0; toc-label-inherits1:1; text-folded:0; top-shadow:0; list-decimal:.; bot-space:0.02in; margin-left:0pt; top-space:0.02in; bot-shadow:0; right-shadow:0; toc-has-label1:1; orphans:2; toc-page-type4:numeric; toc-tab-leader3:dot; toc-label-inherits3:1; shading-pattern:0; toc-heading:Contents; text-indent:0in; toc-source-style1:Heading 1; toc-source-style2:Heading 2; toc-source-style3:Heading 3; widows:2; toc-tab-leader1:dot; margin-right:0pt; toc-label-inherits2:1; toc-tab-leader4:dot; toc-label-inherits4:1; toc-page-type2:numeric; keep-with-next:no; toc-indent1:0.5in; toc-indent2:0.5in; text-folded-id:0; toc-indent4:0.5in; list-tag:0; top-shadow-color:grey; margin-top:0pt; text-align:left; toc-page-type1:numeric; line-height:1.0; toc-page-type3:numeric; toc-has-label2:1; toc-has-label3:1; toc-has-label4:1; toc-tab-leader2:dot; border-merge:0; margin-bottom:0pt; default-tab-interval:0.5in; toc-label-start1:1; toc-label-start2:1; right-shadow-color:grey; toc-dest-style1:Contents 1; toc-source-style4:Heading 4; shading-foreground-color:white; toc-has-heading:1; list-delim:%L; start-value:1; left-shadow:0; bot-shadow-color:grey; toc-heading-style:Contents Header; left-space:0.02in; toc-label-start3:1; toc-label-start4:1; toc-dest-style2:Contents 2; toc-dest-style3:Contents 3; toc-dest-style4:Contents 4; keep-together:no; shading-background-color:white; dom-dir:ltr; format:%*%d.; toc-indent3:0.5in"><c props="width:0in; font-family:Times New Roman; display:inline; font-variant:normal; font-weight:normal; lang:-none-; font-style:normal; text-transform:none; list-style:None; color:000000; bgcolor:ffff00; font-size:12pt; homogeneous:1; text-decoration:none; height:0in; text-position:normal; font-stretch:normal">2. use mongoose middleware.</c><c props="width:0in; font-family:Times New Roman; display:inline; font-variant:normal; font-weight:normal; lang:-none-; font-style:normal; text-transform:none; list-style:None; color:000000; bgcolor:ffff00; font-size:12pt; homogeneous:1; text-decoration:none; height:0in; text-position:normal; font-stretch:normal"></c></p>
<p xid="723"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p xid="274">use Pre hook of mongoosse middleware to perform actions, like encrypt password<c></c></p>
<p xid="275"><a xlink:href="https://mongoosejs.com/docs/middleware.html#pre" xid="725">https://mongoosejs.com/docs/middleware.html#pre<c></c></a></p>
<p xid="276"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p xid="726" props="left-shadow-color:grey; right-space:0.02in; toc-label-type1:numeric; toc-label-type2:numeric; toc-label-type3:numeric; toc-label-type4:numeric; border-shadow-merge:0; toc-label-inherits1:1; text-folded:0; top-shadow:0; list-decimal:.; bot-space:0.02in; margin-left:0pt; top-space:0.02in; bot-shadow:0; right-shadow:0; toc-has-label1:1; orphans:2; toc-page-type4:numeric; toc-tab-leader3:dot; toc-label-inherits3:1; shading-pattern:0; toc-heading:Contents; text-indent:0in; toc-source-style1:Heading 1; toc-source-style2:Heading 2; toc-source-style3:Heading 3; widows:2; toc-tab-leader1:dot; margin-right:0pt; toc-label-inherits2:1; toc-tab-leader4:dot; toc-label-inherits4:1; toc-page-type2:numeric; keep-with-next:no; toc-indent1:0.5in; toc-indent2:0.5in; text-folded-id:0; toc-indent4:0.5in; list-tag:0; top-shadow-color:grey; margin-top:0pt; text-align:left; toc-page-type1:numeric; line-height:1.0; toc-page-type3:numeric; toc-has-label2:1; toc-has-label3:1; toc-has-label4:1; toc-tab-leader2:dot; border-merge:0; margin-bottom:0pt; default-tab-interval:0.5in; toc-label-start1:1; toc-label-start2:1; right-shadow-color:grey; toc-dest-style1:Contents 1; toc-source-style4:Heading 4; shading-foreground-color:white; toc-has-heading:1; list-delim:%L; start-value:1; left-shadow:0; bot-shadow-color:grey; toc-heading-style:Contents Header; left-space:0.02in; toc-label-start3:1; toc-label-start4:1; toc-dest-style2:Contents 2; toc-dest-style3:Contents 3; toc-dest-style4:Contents 4; keep-together:no; shading-background-color:white; dom-dir:ltr; format:%*%d.; toc-indent3:0.5in"><c></c><c props="width:0in; font-family:Times New Roman; display:inline; font-variant:normal; font-weight:normal; lang:-none-; font-style:normal; text-transform:none; list-style:None; color:000000; bgcolor:ffff00; font-size:12pt; homogeneous:1; text-decoration:none; height:0in; text-position:normal; font-stretch:normal">3.</c>bcrypt</p>
<p xid="727"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p xid="731"><c props="font-weight:bold">Hashing a password</c><c props="font-weight:bold"></c></p>
<p xid="730"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p xid="278"><c props="bgcolor:c0c0c0">userSchema.pre("save", async function (next) {</c><c props="bgcolor:c0c0c0"></c></p>
<p xid="279"><c props="bgcolor:c0c0c0">//</c><c props="bgcolor:c0c0c0"></c></p>
<p xid="280"><c props="bgcolor:c0c0c0">check if password field modified, return if not password modified</c><c props="bgcolor:c0c0c0"></c></p>
<p xid="281"><c props="bgcolor:c0c0c0">if (!this.isModified("password")) return next();</c><c props="bgcolor:c0c0c0"></c></p>
<p xid="282"><c props="bgcolor:c0c0c0">this.password = bcrypt.hash(this.password, 10);</c><c props="bgcolor:c0c0c0"></c></p>
<p xid="283"><c props="bgcolor:c0c0c0">});</c><c props="bgcolor:c0c0c0"></c></p>
<p xid="728"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p xid="284"><c props="font-weight:bold">create a custom method to check if password is correct</c><c props="font-weight:bold"></c></p>
<p xid="729"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p xid="285">userSchema.methods.isPasswordCorrect = async function(password){<c></c></p>
<p xid="286">return await bcrypt.compare(password, this.password);<c></c></p>
<p xid="732" props="left-shadow-color:grey; right-space:0.02in; toc-label-type1:numeric; toc-label-type2:numeric; toc-label-type3:numeric; toc-label-type4:numeric; border-shadow-merge:0; toc-label-inherits1:1; text-folded:0; top-shadow:0; list-decimal:.; bot-space:0.02in; margin-left:0pt; top-space:0.02in; bot-shadow:0; right-shadow:0; toc-has-label1:1; orphans:2; toc-page-type4:numeric; toc-tab-leader3:dot; toc-label-inherits3:1; shading-pattern:0; toc-heading:Contents; text-indent:0in; toc-source-style1:Heading 1; toc-source-style2:Heading 2; toc-source-style3:Heading 3; widows:2; toc-tab-leader1:dot; margin-right:0pt; toc-label-inherits2:1; toc-tab-leader4:dot; toc-label-inherits4:1; toc-page-type2:numeric; keep-with-next:no; toc-indent1:0.5in; toc-indent2:0.5in; text-folded-id:0; toc-indent4:0.5in; list-tag:0; top-shadow-color:grey; margin-top:0pt; text-align:left; toc-page-type1:numeric; line-height:1.0; toc-page-type3:numeric; toc-has-label2:1; toc-has-label3:1; toc-has-label4:1; toc-tab-leader2:dot; border-merge:0; margin-bottom:0pt; default-tab-interval:0.5in; toc-label-start1:1; toc-label-start2:1; right-shadow-color:grey; toc-dest-style1:Contents 1; toc-source-style4:Heading 4; shading-foreground-color:white; toc-has-heading:1; list-delim:%L; start-value:1; left-shadow:0; bot-shadow-color:grey; toc-heading-style:Contents Header; left-space:0.02in; toc-label-start3:1; toc-label-start4:1; toc-dest-style2:Contents 2; toc-dest-style3:Contents 3; toc-dest-style4:Contents 4; keep-together:no; shading-background-color:white; dom-dir:ltr; format:%*%d.; toc-indent3:0.5in"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p xid="287" props="left-shadow-color:grey; right-space:0.02in; toc-label-type1:numeric; toc-label-type2:numeric; toc-label-type3:numeric; toc-label-type4:numeric; border-shadow-merge:0; toc-label-inherits1:1; text-folded:0; top-shadow:0; list-decimal:.; bot-space:0.02in; margin-left:0pt; top-space:0.02in; bot-shadow:0; right-shadow:0; toc-has-label1:1; orphans:2; toc-page-type4:numeric; toc-tab-leader3:dot; toc-label-inherits3:1; shading-pattern:0; toc-heading:Contents; text-indent:0in; toc-source-style1:Heading 1; toc-source-style2:Heading 2; toc-source-style3:Heading 3; widows:2; toc-tab-leader1:dot; margin-right:0pt; toc-label-inherits2:1; toc-tab-leader4:dot; toc-label-inherits4:1; toc-page-type2:numeric; keep-with-next:no; toc-indent1:0.5in; toc-indent2:0.5in; text-folded-id:0; toc-indent4:0.5in; list-tag:0; top-shadow-color:grey; margin-top:0pt; text-align:left; toc-page-type1:numeric; line-height:1.0; toc-page-type3:numeric; toc-has-label2:1; toc-has-label3:1; toc-has-label4:1; toc-tab-leader2:dot; border-merge:0; margin-bottom:0pt; default-tab-interval:0.5in; toc-label-start1:1; toc-label-start2:1; right-shadow-color:grey; toc-dest-style1:Contents 1; toc-source-style4:Heading 4; shading-foreground-color:white; toc-has-heading:1; list-delim:%L; start-value:1; left-shadow:0; bot-shadow-color:grey; toc-heading-style:Contents Header; left-space:0.02in; toc-label-start3:1; toc-label-start4:1; toc-dest-style2:Contents 2; toc-dest-style3:Contents 3; toc-dest-style4:Contents 4; keep-together:no; shading-background-color:white; dom-dir:ltr; format:%*%d.; toc-indent3:0.5in"><c props="width:0in; font-family:Times New Roman; display:inline; font-variant:normal; font-weight:bold; lang:-none-; font-style:normal; text-transform:none; list-style:None; color:000000; bgcolor:ff80c0; font-size:18pt; homogeneous:1; text-decoration:none; height:0in; text-position:normal; font-stretch:normal">8. JWT - JWT is bearer token.</c><c props="width:0in; font-family:Times New Roman; display:inline; font-variant:normal; font-weight:bold; lang:-none-; font-style:normal; text-transform:none; list-style:None; color:000000; bgcolor:ff80c0; font-size:18pt; homogeneous:1; text-decoration:none; height:0in; text-position:normal; font-stretch:normal"></c></p>
<p xid="288"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p xid="733"><c></c>JWT (JSON Web Token) is a compact, URL-safe token format used for securely transmitting information between client and server.</p>
<p xid="737"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p xid="738">Token can be:</p>
<p xid="739">1. Access Token - short validity (1d)</p>
<p xid="740">2. Refresh Token - long validity (30d)</p>
<p xid="741"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p xid="742">Explainations:</p>
<p xid="743"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p xid="744">step 1: User logged in provided credentials </p>
<p xid="748"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p xid="749">Server generate Access token and refresh token. </p>
<p xid="750">Acess Token : stored in HTTP - only cookies  or memory/ localStorage</p>
<p xid="745">Refresh Token : alwasy in HTTP - only cookies , never in localStorage, also can be stored in DB with OS and browser info</p>
<p xid="746"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p xid="751">Step 2: After login user Perform operation that time with each operation request access token attached to show the authenticity of the request.</p>
<p xid="752"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p xid="753">Step 3: When access token expired then browser automatically sends the refresh token (via cookies).  <br/><br/>Server check is the refresh token still valid(does it match the user + device info) and then new access token issued. </p>
<p xid="756"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p xid="757" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">If  =&gt;  server issues new access token (sometimes also rotates a new refresh token).</p>
<p xid="758" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p xid="759" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">If  =&gt; (token not found, revoked, or device mismatch) → server says 401 Unauthorized → user must log in again.</p>
<p xid="754"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p xid="760" props="left-shadow-color:grey; right-space:0.02in; toc-label-type1:numeric; toc-label-type2:numeric; toc-label-type3:numeric; toc-label-type4:numeric; border-shadow-merge:0; toc-label-inherits1:1; text-folded:0; top-shadow:0; list-decimal:.; bot-space:0.02in; margin-left:0pt; top-space:0.02in; bot-shadow:0; right-shadow:0; toc-has-label1:1; orphans:2; toc-page-type4:numeric; toc-tab-leader3:dot; toc-label-inherits3:1; shading-pattern:0; toc-heading:Contents; text-indent:0in; toc-source-style1:Heading 1; toc-source-style2:Heading 2; toc-source-style3:Heading 3; widows:2; toc-tab-leader1:dot; margin-right:0pt; toc-label-inherits2:1; toc-tab-leader4:dot; toc-label-inherits4:1; toc-page-type2:numeric; keep-with-next:no; toc-indent1:0.5in; toc-indent2:0.5in; text-folded-id:0; toc-indent4:0.5in; list-tag:0; top-shadow-color:grey; margin-top:0pt; text-align:left; toc-page-type1:numeric; line-height:1.0; toc-page-type3:numeric; toc-has-label2:1; toc-has-label3:1; toc-has-label4:1; toc-tab-leader2:dot; border-merge:0; margin-bottom:0pt; default-tab-interval:0.5in; toc-label-start1:1; toc-label-start2:1; right-shadow-color:grey; toc-dest-style1:Contents 1; toc-source-style4:Heading 4; shading-foreground-color:white; toc-has-heading:1; list-delim:%L; start-value:1; left-shadow:0; bot-shadow-color:grey; toc-heading-style:Contents Header; left-space:0.02in; toc-label-start3:1; toc-label-start4:1; toc-dest-style2:Contents 2; toc-dest-style3:Contents 3; toc-dest-style4:Contents 4; keep-together:no; shading-background-color:white; dom-dir:ltr; format:%*%d.; toc-indent3:0.5in"><c props="width:0in; font-family:Times New Roman; display:inline; font-variant:normal; font-weight:bold; lang:-none-; font-style:normal; text-transform:none; list-style:None; color:000000; bgcolor:ffff00; font-size:12pt; homogeneous:1; text-decoration:none; height:0in; text-position:normal; font-stretch:normal">Token Rotation</c><c props="width:0in; font-family:Times New Roman; display:inline; font-variant:normal; font-weight:bold; lang:-none-; font-style:normal; text-transform:none; list-style:None; color:000000; bgcolor:ffff00; font-size:12pt; homogeneous:1; text-decoration:none; height:0in; text-position:normal; font-stretch:normal"></c></p>
<p xid="761" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p xid="762" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">Many modern systems rotate refresh tokens.</p>
<p xid="763" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p xid="764" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">Example: when user refreshes access token, server also issues a new refresh token and invalidates the old one.</p>
<p xid="765" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p xid="766" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">This makes it harder for an attacker to reuse a stolen refresh token.</p>
<p xid="755"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p xid="767" props="left-shadow-color:grey; right-space:0.02in; toc-label-type1:numeric; toc-label-type2:numeric; toc-label-type3:numeric; toc-label-type4:numeric; border-shadow-merge:0; toc-label-inherits1:1; text-folded:0; top-shadow:0; list-decimal:.; bot-space:0.02in; margin-left:0pt; top-space:0.02in; bot-shadow:0; right-shadow:0; toc-has-label1:1; orphans:2; toc-page-type4:numeric; toc-tab-leader3:dot; toc-label-inherits3:1; shading-pattern:0; toc-heading:Contents; text-indent:0in; toc-source-style1:Heading 1; toc-source-style2:Heading 2; toc-source-style3:Heading 3; widows:2; toc-tab-leader1:dot; margin-right:0pt; toc-label-inherits2:1; toc-tab-leader4:dot; toc-label-inherits4:1; toc-page-type2:numeric; keep-with-next:no; toc-indent1:0.5in; toc-indent2:0.5in; text-folded-id:0; toc-indent4:0.5in; list-tag:0; top-shadow-color:grey; margin-top:0pt; text-align:left; toc-page-type1:numeric; line-height:1.0; toc-page-type3:numeric; toc-has-label2:1; toc-has-label3:1; toc-has-label4:1; toc-tab-leader2:dot; border-merge:0; margin-bottom:0pt; default-tab-interval:0.5in; toc-label-start1:1; toc-label-start2:1; right-shadow-color:grey; toc-dest-style1:Contents 1; toc-source-style4:Heading 4; shading-foreground-color:white; toc-has-heading:1; list-delim:%L; start-value:1; left-shadow:0; bot-shadow-color:grey; toc-heading-style:Contents Header; left-space:0.02in; toc-label-start3:1; toc-label-start4:1; toc-dest-style2:Contents 2; toc-dest-style3:Contents 3; toc-dest-style4:Contents 4; keep-together:no; shading-background-color:white; dom-dir:ltr; format:%*%d.; toc-indent3:0.5in"><c props="width:0in; font-family:Times New Roman; display:inline; font-variant:normal; font-weight:bold; lang:-none-; font-style:normal; text-transform:none; list-style:None; color:000000; bgcolor:ffff00; font-size:12pt; homogeneous:1; text-decoration:none; height:0in; text-position:normal; font-stretch:normal">Creation of token</c><c props="width:0in; font-family:Times New Roman; display:inline; font-variant:normal; font-weight:bold; lang:-none-; font-style:normal; text-transform:none; list-style:None; color:000000; bgcolor:ffff00; font-size:12pt; homogeneous:1; text-decoration:none; height:0in; text-position:normal; font-stretch:normal"></c></p>
<p xid="289"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p xid="768">Important to know:</p>
<p xid="769">1. Token will be created by the JWT(jwt.sign()). </p>
<p xid="770">2. We can attach the helper methods on the schema. </p>
<p xid="771">example: we have attached helper method to the model User.</p>
<p xid="772">3. So every User object will generate a new token. </p>
<p xid="773">4. Attaching the helpmer method to Schema user object will be done by using the mongoDB Schema methods. </p>
<p xid="774"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p xid="775"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p xid="777"><c></c>Example as below:</p>
<p xid="776" props="font-family:Times New Roman; color:000000; font-size:12pt; text-position:normal; lang:-none-; bgcolor:c0c0c0; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal; text-decoration:none"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p xid="778"><c props="bgcolor:c0c0c0">userSchema.methods.generateAccessToken=()=&gt;{</c><c props="bgcolor:c0c0c0"></c></p>
<p xid="947"><c props="bgcolor:c0c0c0"> return jwt.sign({</c><c props="bgcolor:c0c0c0"></c></p>
<p xid="948"><c props="bgcolor:c0c0c0"> _id : this._id,</c><c props="bgcolor:c0c0c0"></c></p>
<p xid="949"><c props="bgcolor:c0c0c0">name : this.name,</c><c props="bgcolor:c0c0c0"></c></p>
<p xid="950"><c props="bgcolor:c0c0c0">email : this.email</c><c props="bgcolor:c0c0c0"></c></p>
<p xid="951"><c props="bgcolor:c0c0c0"></c><c props="bgcolor:c0c0c0">},</c></p>
<p xid="952"><c props="bgcolor:c0c0c0"></c><c props="bgcolor:c0c0c0">process.env.ACCESS_TOKEN_SECRET,</c></p>
<p xid="953"><c props="bgcolor:c0c0c0"></c><c props="bgcolor:c0c0c0">{</c></p>
<p xid="954"><c props="bgcolor:c0c0c0">expiresIn:”1d”</c><c props="bgcolor:c0c0c0"></c></p>
<p xid="955"><c props="bgcolor:c0c0c0"></c><c props="bgcolor:c0c0c0">})</c></p>
<p xid="956"><c props="bgcolor:c0c0c0"></c><c props="bgcolor:c0c0c0">}</c></p>
<p xid="957"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p xid="791"><c props="font-weight:bold">So basically while creating a token it takes below:</c><c props="font-weight:bold"></c></p>
<p xid="792"><c props="font-style:italic; font-weight:normal"></c><c></c></p>
<p xid="794"><c props="font-style:italic; font-weight:normal"></c><c props="bgcolor:c0c0c0; font-weight:normal; font-style:italic">jwt,sign(authorization, token_secret, expiry);</c></p>
<p xid="793"><c props="font-style:italic; font-weight:normal"></c><c></c></p>
<p xid="790">--------------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p xid="795"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p xid="796"><c props="font-weight:bold">Once token created it holds the information as below:</c><c props="font-weight:bold"></c></p>
<p xid="797"><c props="font-weight:bold"></c><c></c></p>
<p xid="798"><c props="font-weight:normal"></c><c props="width:0in; font-family:Times New Roman; display:inline; font-variant:normal; font-weight:normal; lang:-none-; font-style:normal; text-transform:none; color:000000; homogeneous:1; bgcolor:ffff00; font-size:12pt; text-decoration:none; list-style:None; height:0in; text-position:normal; font-stretch:normal">A JWT has three parts, separated by dots (.)</c></p>
<p xid="290" props="left-shadow-color:grey; right-space:0.02in; toc-label-type1:numeric; toc-label-type2:numeric; toc-label-type3:numeric; toc-label-type4:numeric; border-shadow-merge:0; toc-label-inherits1:1; text-folded:0; top-shadow:0; list-decimal:.; bot-space:0.02in; margin-left:0pt; top-space:0.02in; bot-shadow:0; right-shadow:0; toc-has-label1:1; orphans:2; toc-page-type4:numeric; toc-tab-leader3:dot; toc-label-inherits3:1; shading-pattern:0; toc-heading:Contents; text-indent:0in; toc-source-style1:Heading 1; toc-source-style2:Heading 2; toc-source-style3:Heading 3; widows:2; toc-tab-leader1:dot; margin-right:0pt; toc-label-inherits2:1; toc-tab-leader4:dot; toc-label-inherits4:1; toc-page-type2:numeric; keep-with-next:no; toc-indent1:0.5in; toc-indent2:0.5in; text-folded-id:0; toc-indent4:0.5in; list-tag:0; top-shadow-color:grey; margin-top:0pt; text-align:left; toc-page-type1:numeric; line-height:1.0; toc-page-type3:numeric; toc-has-label2:1; toc-has-label3:1; toc-has-label4:1; toc-tab-leader2:dot; border-merge:0; margin-bottom:0pt; default-tab-interval:0.5in; toc-label-start1:1; toc-label-start2:1; right-shadow-color:grey; toc-dest-style1:Contents 1; toc-source-style4:Heading 4; shading-foreground-color:white; toc-has-heading:1; list-delim:%L; start-value:1; left-shadow:0; bot-shadow-color:grey; toc-heading-style:Contents Header; left-space:0.02in; toc-label-start3:1; toc-label-start4:1; toc-dest-style2:Contents 2; toc-dest-style3:Contents 3; toc-dest-style4:Contents 4; keep-together:no; shading-background-color:white; dom-dir:ltr; format:%*%d.; toc-indent3:0.5in"><c props="font-weight:normal"></c><c></c></p>
<p xid="735"><c props="font-weight:normal"></c><c props="font-weight:normal">Header.Payload.Signature</c></p>
<p xid="799" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p xid="801" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c>xxxxx.yyyyy.zzzzz</p>
<p xid="800" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p xid="291"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p xid="736"><c></c>Create secret tokens in .env file</p>
<p xid="292"><c props="bgcolor:c0c0c0">ACCESS_TOKEN_SECRET=4a20780449da3e09f0f0ffdae1dc909cc884d96c08553a14402a8c066441f0bb</c><c props="bgcolor:c0c0c0"></c></p>
<p xid="293"><c props="bgcolor:c0c0c0">ACCESS_TOKEN_EXPIRY=1d</c><c props="bgcolor:c0c0c0"></c></p>
<p xid="294"><c props="bgcolor:c0c0c0">REFRESH_TOKEN_SECRET=66b148fec838e56c717745baf0d0bde5c302c3d0836e6e7fcd9a5554cc62307e</c><c props="bgcolor:c0c0c0"></c></p>
<p xid="295"><c props="bgcolor:c0c0c0">REFRESH_TOKEN_EXPIRY=10d</c><c props="bgcolor:c0c0c0"></c></p>
<p xid="296"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p xid="802"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p xid="307" props="left-shadow-color:grey; right-space:0.02in; toc-label-type1:numeric; toc-label-type2:numeric; toc-label-type3:numeric; toc-label-type4:numeric; border-shadow-merge:0; toc-label-inherits1:1; text-folded:0; top-shadow:0; list-decimal:.; bot-space:0.02in; margin-left:0pt; top-space:0.02in; bot-shadow:0; right-shadow:0; toc-has-label1:1; orphans:2; toc-page-type4:numeric; toc-tab-leader3:dot; toc-label-inherits3:1; shading-pattern:0; toc-heading:Contents; text-indent:0in; toc-source-style1:Heading 1; toc-source-style2:Heading 2; toc-source-style3:Heading 3; widows:2; toc-tab-leader1:dot; margin-right:0pt; toc-label-inherits2:1; toc-tab-leader4:dot; toc-label-inherits4:1; toc-page-type2:numeric; keep-with-next:no; toc-indent1:0.5in; toc-indent2:0.5in; text-folded-id:0; toc-indent4:0.5in; list-tag:0; top-shadow-color:grey; margin-top:0pt; text-align:left; toc-page-type1:numeric; line-height:1.0; toc-page-type3:numeric; toc-has-label2:1; toc-has-label3:1; toc-has-label4:1; toc-tab-leader2:dot; border-merge:0; margin-bottom:0pt; default-tab-interval:0.5in; toc-label-start1:1; toc-label-start2:1; right-shadow-color:grey; toc-dest-style1:Contents 1; toc-source-style4:Heading 4; shading-foreground-color:white; toc-has-heading:1; list-delim:%L; start-value:1; left-shadow:0; bot-shadow-color:grey; toc-heading-style:Contents Header; left-space:0.02in; toc-label-start3:1; toc-label-start4:1; toc-dest-style2:Contents 2; toc-dest-style3:Contents 3; toc-dest-style4:Contents 4; keep-together:no; shading-background-color:white; dom-dir:ltr; format:%*%d.; toc-indent3:0.5in"><c props="width:0in; font-family:Times New Roman; display:inline; font-variant:normal; font-weight:bold; lang:-none-; font-style:normal; text-transform:none; list-style:None; color:000000; bgcolor:ff80c0; font-size:18pt; homogeneous:1; text-decoration:none; height:0in; text-position:normal; font-stretch:normal">9. How to upload file in backend</c><c props="width:0in; font-family:Times New Roman; display:inline; font-variant:normal; font-weight:bold; lang:-none-; font-style:normal; text-transform:none; list-style:None; color:000000; bgcolor:ff80c0; font-size:18pt; homogeneous:1; text-decoration:none; height:0in; text-position:normal; font-stretch:normal"></c></p>
<p xid="803" props="left-shadow-color:grey; right-space:0.02in; toc-label-type1:numeric; toc-label-type2:numeric; toc-label-type3:numeric; toc-label-type4:numeric; border-shadow-merge:0; toc-label-inherits1:1; text-folded:0; top-shadow:0; list-decimal:.; bot-space:0.02in; margin-left:0pt; top-space:0.02in; bot-shadow:0; right-shadow:0; toc-has-label1:1; orphans:2; toc-page-type4:numeric; toc-tab-leader3:dot; toc-label-inherits3:1; shading-pattern:0; toc-heading:Contents; text-indent:0in; toc-source-style1:Heading 1; toc-source-style2:Heading 2; toc-source-style3:Heading 3; widows:2; toc-tab-leader1:dot; margin-right:0pt; toc-label-inherits2:1; toc-tab-leader4:dot; toc-label-inherits4:1; toc-page-type2:numeric; keep-with-next:no; toc-indent1:0.5in; toc-indent2:0.5in; text-folded-id:0; toc-indent4:0.5in; list-tag:0; top-shadow-color:grey; margin-top:0pt; text-align:left; toc-page-type1:numeric; line-height:1.0; toc-page-type3:numeric; toc-has-label2:1; toc-has-label3:1; toc-has-label4:1; toc-tab-leader2:dot; border-merge:0; margin-bottom:0pt; default-tab-interval:0.5in; toc-label-start1:1; toc-label-start2:1; right-shadow-color:grey; toc-dest-style1:Contents 1; toc-source-style4:Heading 4; shading-foreground-color:white; toc-has-heading:1; list-delim:%L; start-value:1; left-shadow:0; bot-shadow-color:grey; toc-heading-style:Contents Header; left-space:0.02in; toc-label-start3:1; toc-label-start4:1; toc-dest-style2:Contents 2; toc-dest-style3:Contents 3; toc-dest-style4:Contents 4; keep-together:no; shading-background-color:white; dom-dir:ltr; format:%*%d.; toc-indent3:0.5in"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p xid="308">In order to upload teh files on the server , we will use the <c props="font-weight:bold">multer.</c><c props="font-weight:bold"></c></p>
<p xid="808"><c props="font-weight:normal"></c><c></c></p>
<p xid="859"><c props="font-weight:normal">npm install multer</c><c props="font-weight:normal"></c></p>
<p xid="858"><c props="font-weight:normal"></c><c></c></p>
<p xid="809"><c props="font-weight:normal">Folder - middlewares</c><c props="font-weight:normal"></c></p>
<p xid="810"><c props="font-weight:normal">   - multer.middleware.js</c><c props="font-weight:normal"></c></p>
<p xid="811"><c props="font-weight:normal"></c><c></c></p>
<p xid="812"><c props="font-weight:bold">Step1: import multer </c><c props="font-weight:bold"></c></p>
<p xid="813"><c props="font-weight:bold">Step 2: storage engine configuration</c><c props="font-weight:bold"></c></p>
<p xid="814"><c props="font-weight:normal">            </c><c props="font-weight:normal"></c></p>
<p xid="816"><c props="font-weight:normal; bgcolor:c0c0c0">const storage = multer.diskStorage({....})</c><c props="font-weight:normal; bgcolor:c0c0c0"></c></p>
<p xid="804"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p xid="817"><c props="font-weight:bold">Step 3: multer.diskStorage tells how to store files on disk.</c><c props="font-weight:bold"></c></p>
<p xid="821"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p xid="822"><c props="font-family:Times New Roman; text-decoration:none; color:000000; font-size:12pt; text-position:normal; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal; lang:-none-"></c><c props="font-family:Times New Roman; color:000000; font-size:12pt; text-position:normal; text-decoration:none; bgcolor:c0c0c0; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal; lang:-none-">const storage = multer.diskStorage(</c></p>
<p xid="823"><c props="font-family:Times New Roman; color:000000; font-size:12pt; text-position:normal; text-decoration:none; bgcolor:c0c0c0; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal; lang:-none-"></c><c props="font-family:Times New Roman; color:000000; font-size:12pt; text-position:normal; text-decoration:none; bgcolor:c0c0c0; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal; lang:-none-">{</c></p>
<p xid="824"><c props="font-family:Times New Roman; color:000000; font-size:12pt; text-position:normal; text-decoration:none; bgcolor:c0c0c0; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal; lang:-none-"></c><c props="font-family:Times New Roman; color:000000; font-size:12pt; text-position:normal; text-decoration:none; bgcolor:c0c0c0; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal; lang:-none-">destination: (req, file, cb)=&gt;{},</c></p>
<p xid="819"><c props="font-family:Times New Roman; color:000000; font-size:12pt; text-position:normal; text-decoration:none; bgcolor:c0c0c0; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal; lang:-none-">filename: (req, file ,cb)=&gt;{}</c><c props="font-family:Times New Roman; color:000000; font-size:12pt; text-position:normal; text-decoration:none; bgcolor:c0c0c0; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal; lang:-none-"></c></p>
<p xid="820"><c props="font-family:Times New Roman; color:000000; font-size:12pt; text-position:normal; text-decoration:none; bgcolor:c0c0c0; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal; lang:-none-"></c><c props="font-family:Times New Roman; color:000000; font-size:12pt; text-position:normal; text-decoration:none; bgcolor:c0c0c0; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal; lang:-none-">})</c></p>
<p xid="829"><c props="font-family:Times New Roman; text-decoration:none; color:000000; font-size:12pt; text-position:normal; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal; lang:-none-"></c><c></c></p>
<p xid="830"><c props="font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:12pt; color:000000; text-decoration:none; text-position:normal; font-weight:bold; font-style:normal; lang:-none-">Step 4: Create a destination in cb to save the files in that folder.</c><c props="font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:12pt; color:000000; text-decoration:none; text-position:normal; font-weight:bold; font-style:normal; lang:-none-"></c></p>
<p xid="831"><c props="font-family:Times New Roman; text-decoration:none; color:000000; font-size:12pt; text-position:normal; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal; lang:-none-"></c><c></c></p>
<p xid="832"><c props="font-family:Times New Roman; text-decoration:none; color:000000; font-size:12pt; text-position:normal; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal; lang:-none-">//absolute path</c><c props="font-family:Times New Roman; text-decoration:none; color:000000; font-size:12pt; text-position:normal; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal; lang:-none-"></c></p>
<p xid="833"><c props="font-family:Times New Roman; text-decoration:none; color:000000; font-size:12pt; text-position:normal; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal; lang:-none-"></c><c></c></p>
<p xid="836"><c props="font-family:Times New Roman; text-decoration:none; color:000000; font-size:12pt; text-position:normal; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal; lang:-none-"></c><c props="font-family:Times New Roman; color:000000; font-size:12pt; text-position:normal; text-decoration:none; bgcolor:c0c0c0; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal; lang:-none-">import path from “path”;</c></p>
<p xid="834"><c props="font-family:Times New Roman; color:000000; font-size:12pt; text-position:normal; text-decoration:none; bgcolor:c0c0c0; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal; lang:-none-">import { fileUrlToPath } from “url”;</c><c props="font-family:Times New Roman; color:000000; font-size:12pt; text-position:normal; text-decoration:none; bgcolor:c0c0c0; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal; lang:-none-"></c></p>
