; display:inline; font-variant:normal; font-weight:bold; text-position:normal; lang:-none-; font-style:normal; text-transform:none; list-style:None; homogeneous:1; bgcolor:ff80c0; text-decoration:none; color:000000; height:0in; font-size:18pt; font-stretch:normal"></c></p>
<p xid="314"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p xid="890"><c></c><c props="font-weight:bold">Step1</c>: Generate API Key:</p>
<p xid="897"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p xid="316"><c props="font-weight:bold">Step 2</c><c props="font-weight:bold"></c>: Choose your SDk</p>
<p xid="318"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p xid="898"><c></c><c props="font-weight:bold">Step 3</c>: install cloudinary</p>
<p xid="806"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p xid="904"><c></c>npm install cloudinary</p>
<p xid="321"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p xid="900"><c></c><c props="font-weight:bold">Step 4</c>: create a folder and file as below</p>
<p xid="903"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p xid="323">folder - util<c></c></p>
<p xid="324"><c props="font-weight:normal">       - cloudinary.js</c><c props="font-weight:normal"></c><c props="font-weight:bold"> </c><c props="font-weight:normal">(file)</c></p>
<p xid="895"><c props="font-weight:bold"></c><c></c></p>
<p xid="325"><c props="bgcolor:c0c0c0">Import cloudinary:</c><c props="bgcolor:c0c0c0"></c></p>
<p xid="326"><c props="bgcolor:c0c0c0">import { v2 as cloudinary } from 'cloudinary';</c><c props="bgcolor:c0c0c0"></c></p>
<p xid="327"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p xid="896"><c></c><c props="font-weight:bold">Step 5</c>:</p>
<p xid="901"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p xid="328">Create cloudinary configuration<c></c></p>
<p xid="902"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p xid="329"><c props="bgcolor:c0c0c0">cloudinary.config({</c><c props="bgcolor:c0c0c0"></c></p>
<p xid="330"><c props="bgcolor:c0c0c0">cloud_name: process,</c><c props="bgcolor:c0c0c0"></c></p>
<p xid="331"><c props="bgcolor:c0c0c0">api_key: process.env.CLOUD_API_KEY,</c><c props="bgcolor:c0c0c0"></c></p>
<p xid="332"><c props="bgcolor:c0c0c0">api_secret: process.env.CLOUD_API_SECRET</c><c props="bgcolor:c0c0c0"></c></p>
<p xid="333"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p xid="905"><c></c><c props="font-weight:bold">step 6</c>:</p>
<p xid="334"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p xid="907"><c props="font-weight:bold; font-style:italic">Now start using the cloudinary</c><c props="font-weight:bold; font-style:italic"></c></p>
<p xid="908"><c props="font-style:italic"></c><c></c></p>
<p xid="335">Uploading the images first on server and then from server to cloudinary<c></c></p>
<p xid="909"><c props="bgcolor:ffff80">Create a function to uplaod the files to cloudinary and then export that function to use in conntroller:</c><c props="bgcolor:ffff80"></c></p>
<p xid="910"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p xid="912"><c props="font-style:italic; font-weight:bold">What we focus on doing in this function:</c><c props="font-style:italic; font-weight:bold"></c></p>
<p xid="911"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p xid="913"><c props="font-weight:bold">a) Provide server path where we have uploaded images</c><c props="font-weight:bold"></c></p>
<p xid="914"><c props="font-weight:bold">  </c><c props="font-weight:bold"></c></p>
<p xid="916"><c props="font-weight:normal; bgcolor:fc70d9">localFilePath</c><c props="font-weight:normal; bgcolor:fc70d9"></c></p>
<p xid="915"><c props="font-weight:normal"></c><c></c></p>
<p xid="917"><c props="font-weight:bold">b) use try-catch with aync-await</c><c props="font-weight:bold"></c></p>
<p xid="918"><c props="font-weight:normal"></c><c></c></p>
<p xid="919"><c props="font-weight:normal">try-catch to handle error and since cloudinary will save images on cloud and return the response it takes time, hence we need to await.</c><c props="font-weight:normal"></c></p>
<p xid="920"><c props="font-weight:normal"></c><c></c></p>
<p xid="923"><c props="font-family:Times New Roman; color:000000; text-decoration:none; text-position:normal; font-size:12pt; bgcolor:c0c0c0; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal; lang:-none-">const imageUpload = async(localFilePath) =&gt;{</c><c props="font-family:Times New Roman; color:000000; text-decoration:none; text-position:normal; font-size:12pt; bgcolor:c0c0c0; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal; lang:-none-"></c></p>
<p xid="928"><c props="font-family:Times New Roman; color:000000; text-decoration:none; text-position:normal; font-size:12pt; bgcolor:c0c0c0; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal; lang:-none-"></c><c></c></p>
<p xid="930"><c props="font-family:Times New Roman; color:000000; text-decoration:none; text-position:normal; font-size:12pt; bgcolor:c0c0c0; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal; lang:-none-">if(!localFilePath) return null;</c><c props="font-family:Times New Roman; color:000000; text-decoration:none; text-position:normal; font-size:12pt; bgcolor:c0c0c0; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal; lang:-none-"></c></p>
<p xid="924" props="margin-top:0.0000in; margin-left:0.0000in; text-indent:0.0000in; dom-dir:ltr; margin-bottom:0.0000in; line-height:1.000000; text-align:left; margin-right:0.0000in"><c props="font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:12pt; text-position:normal; lang:-none-; bgcolor:c0c0c0; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal; text-decoration:none">const response = await cloudinary.uploader.upload(localFilePath, {resource_type:"auto”});</c><c props="font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:12pt; text-position:normal; lang:-none-; bgcolor:c0c0c0; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal; text-decoration:none"></c></p>
<p xid="929" props="margin-top:0.0000in; margin-left:0.0000in; text-indent:0.0000in; dom-dir:ltr; margin-bottom:0.0000in; line-height:1.000000; text-align:left; margin-right:0.0000in"><c props="font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:12pt; text-position:normal; lang:-none-; bgcolor:c0c0c0; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal; text-decoration:none"></c><c props="font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:12pt; text-position:normal; lang:-none-; bgcolor:c0c0c0; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal; text-decoration:none">console.log(“File upladed to the cloudnary succesfully”);</c></p>
<p xid="926" props="margin-top:0.0000in; margin-left:0.0000in; text-indent:0.0000in; dom-dir:ltr; margin-bottom:0.0000in; line-height:1.000000; text-align:left; margin-right:0.0000in"><c props="font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:12pt; text-position:normal; lang:-none-; bgcolor:c0c0c0; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal; text-decoration:none">return response;</c><c props="font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:12pt; text-position:normal; lang:-none-; bgcolor:c0c0c0; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal; text-decoration:none"></c></p>
<p xid="931" props="margin-top:0.0000in; margin-left:0.0000in; text-indent:0.0000in; dom-dir:ltr; margin-bottom:0.0000in; line-height:1.000000; text-align:left; margin-right:0.0000in"><c props="font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:12pt; text-position:normal; lang:-none-; bgcolor:c0c0c0; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal; text-decoration:none"></c><c></c></p>
